# One-shot Development-only SQL access provisioning.
# Copy to a root-owned file outside the repository, replace every value, use it
# once with docker --env-file, and securely remove it after verification.
# Keep the existing DBA password (any non-empty, non-placeholder value) and do
# not reuse it for a personal login. The three personal passwords must be
# distinct, 16-128 characters, and use only: A-Z a-z 0-9 ! @ # % _ + = : . , ? -
ELEVANT_DB_DBA_PASSWORD=REPLACE_ME_DbaPassword!2026
ELEVANT_DB_TEAM_ERICK_PASSWORD=REPLACE_ME_ErickPassword!2026
ELEVANT_DB_TEAM_ELIEZER_PASSWORD=REPLACE_ME_EliezerPassword!2026
ELEVANT_DB_TEAM_LAISHA_PASSWORD=REPLACE_ME_LaishaPassword!2026
